#. 【大変な事】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[serious problem]"
msgstr ""

#. セレスさん…
#. 大変な事って、どういう意味…？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Celeste... What do you mean, a \"serious problem\"?"
msgstr ""

#. わたくしが娯楽室を覗いた時、
#. そこには、不審者の他にもう１人いたのです。
msgctxt "0003 | CELES"
msgid ""
"When I looked in the rec room, I saw that the\n"
"suspicious man was not alone. He had with him..."
msgstr ""

#. 山田君でした…
msgctxt "0004 | CELES"
msgid "...Hifumi."
msgstr ""

#. や、山田クン！？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hifumi!?"
msgstr ""

#. しかも、その不審者はわたくしを襲った後、
#. 山田君を連れ去ってしまったのです…
msgctxt "0006 | CELES"
msgid "After he attacked me, he dragged Hifumi away..."
msgstr ""

#. さらわれたという事か！？
msgctxt "0007 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "You mean...Hifumi was kidnapped?"
msgstr ""

#. 急いで捜した方が…よくない？
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Shouldn't we start looking for him, then...?"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、セレスちゃん…
#. その不審者って、何か特徴があった？
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Listen, Celeste...did anything in particular stand out\n"
"about this strange guy?"
msgstr ""

#. 特徴…それは…
msgctxt "0010 | CELES"
msgid "Did anything stand out? Well..."
msgstr ""

#. 口で説明するより、
#. 見て頂いた方が早いかもしれません。
msgctxt "0011 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Rather than trying to explain it, it would probably be\n"
"faster if I simply showed you."
msgstr ""

#. 見て…？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Show us...?"
msgstr ""

#. 例のデジカメですわ。山田君のお下がりの…
msgctxt "0013 | CELES"
msgid "This is Hifumi's hand-me-down. His digital camera..."
msgstr ""

#. もしかして…！
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You don't mean...!"
msgstr ""

#. こっそり、不審者の姿を撮影しておきました。
msgctxt "0015 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I was able to photograph the suspicious individual\n"
"without him realizing it."
msgstr ""

#. ホントにッ！？　見せてッ！
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Seriously!? Let's see it!"
msgstr ""

#. 驚かないでください…
#. と言ったところで難しいかもしれませんが…
msgctxt "0017 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I would tell you not to be shocked, but I fear it\n"
"would do you no good."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな妙な前置きの後、
#. 見せられたデジカメの画像には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With that strange comment in mind, we all looked at\n"
"the camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. ええええええッ！？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Whaaaaaaat!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに…顔を隠した不審者ではあるけど……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, you were definitely right about the \"strange\"\n"
"part... Their face is totally covered.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ロボ…？　コスプレ…？
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Is that a...robot costume?"
msgstr ""

#. まさしく…妙な不審者でしょう…？
msgctxt "0023 | CELES"
msgid ""
"As I said, a very strange and suspicious individual,\n"
"yes?"
msgstr ""

#. えっと…この変なロボに…
#. 山田クンは連れ去られちゃったの…？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So this weird robot guy...dragged Hifumi away?"
msgstr ""

#. しかも、その画像を撮ったのは、
#. わたくしが襲われた時…
msgctxt "0025 | CELES"
msgid "And I took this right after being attacked."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、１時間も前なのです。
msgctxt "0026 | CELES"
msgid "In other words, a full hour ago."
msgstr ""

#. ですから、急がないと…
#. 大変な事になってしまいますわ…
msgctxt "0027 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Which is why if we don't hurry, it could become a\n"
"serious problem."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>娯楽室のドアを開けたボクの目に、
#. 真っ先に飛び込んで来たのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The first thing I saw when I got in the rec room\n"
"was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. う…う……！
msgctxt "0029 | CELES"
msgid "N...ngh...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>傷付いたセレスさんの姿だった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was Celeste. And she was hurt.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うぅ……苗木君…！
msgctxt "0031 | CELES"
msgid "Gh... Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. セ、セレスさん…どうしたの！？
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "C-Celeste! What happened!?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うかつでした…
msgctxt "0033 | CELES"
msgid "I was...stupid."
msgstr ""

#. 襲われてしまいましたわ…
msgctxt "0034 | CELES"
msgid "I got...attacked."
msgstr ""

#. 襲われた！？　誰に！？
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Attacked!? By who!?"
msgstr ""

#. 妙な不審者…でしたわ…
msgctxt "0036 | CELES"
msgid "I am not sure. Some sort of...strange man."
msgstr ""

#. 妙な不審者…？
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Strange man...?"
msgstr ""

#. 存在自体が妙である不審者に、
#. さらに“妙な”という形容詞を付けたくなるほどの…
msgctxt "0038 | CELES"
msgid ""
"A suspicious person whose existence is so unusual, I\n"
"can't help but call him strange..."
msgstr ""

#. まさに、<CLT 3>“妙な不審者”<CLT>でしたわ…
msgctxt "0039 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Without a doubt, it was some sort of <CLT 3>strange\n"
"suspicious individual<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. わたくしは、そんな妙な不審者に襲われたのです。
#. そこに落ちている<CLT 3>“ハンマー”<CLT>で…
msgctxt "0040 | CELES"
msgid ""
"And that man attacked me, with the <CLT 3>hammer<CLT> on the\n"
"ground there..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木、セレスちゃん！！
msgctxt "0041 | NO NAME"
msgid "Makoto! Celeste!"
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃんを連れて来たよッ！
msgctxt "0042 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I found Sakura!"
msgstr ""

#. セ、セレス…
#. 一体どうしたと言うのだ…？
msgctxt "0043 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "C-Celeste... What on Earth happened here?"
msgstr ""

#. 不審者に襲われたらしいんだけど…
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Apparently she was attacked by some kind of strange\n"
"man..."
msgstr ""

#. 不審者…だと？
msgctxt "0045 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "A...strange man?"
msgstr ""

#. …セレスよ、詳しく教えろ。
#. その不審者とやらの事…
msgctxt "0046 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Tell us everything you can remember, Celeste. Be as\n"
"detailed as you can..."
msgstr ""

#. 今朝、わたくしは、夜時間が明ける７時前に
#. 目が覚めてしまいました…
msgctxt "0047 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Well, I woke up this morning a little before 7 a.m.\n"
"Nighttime was not yet over..."
msgstr ""

#. もうすぐ夜時間も明ける事ですし、
#. 少しくらい、いいだろうという甘い考えで…
msgctxt "0048 | CELES"
msgid ""
"But I knew it was about to end, so I decided it would\n"
"be okay if I..."
msgstr ""

#. 学校の１階をぶらぶら散歩していたのです。
msgctxt "0049 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I decided to take a little stroll around the 1st\n"
"floor."
msgstr ""

#. …それが間違いでしたわ。
msgctxt "0050 | CELES"
msgid "...I understand now that that was a mistake."
msgstr ""

#. そこで、わたくしは不審者を見かけたのです。
#. 顔を隠した、見るからに怪しい不審者でしたわ。
msgctxt "0051 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Anyway, that is where I first saw the strange man. I\n"
"was immediately wary of him..."
msgstr ""

#. 見るからに怪しいので、
#. わたくしは、こっそり後をつける事にしたのです。
msgctxt "0052 | CELES"
msgid ""
"He was obviously suspicious, so I decided to follow\n"
"after him in secret."
msgstr ""

#. すると、不審者がこの娯楽室に入ったので、
#. こっそりドアの隙間から中を覗こうとして…
msgctxt "0053 | CELES"
msgid ""
"As I followed, I saw him go into the rec room. I tried\n"
"to peek through the gap in the door..."
msgstr ""

#. …そこで不審者に見つかってしまい、
#. 襲われてしまいました。
msgctxt "0054 | CELES"
msgid "...which is when he noticed me, and..."
msgstr ""

#. では、お主が襲われたのは…
msgctxt "0055 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "And that's when you were attacked."
msgstr ""

#. わたくしが襲われたのは夜時間が明けた直後…
#. <CLT 3>朝の７時過ぎ<CLT>でしたわ…
msgctxt "0056 | CELES"
msgid ""
"It happened <CLT 3>after 7 a.m.<CLT>, just after nighttime had\n"
"ended."
msgstr ""

#. 襲われたのが７時過ぎって事は…
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So if it happened just after 7 o'clock..."
msgstr ""

#. 今から１時間ほど前だな。
#. 我らが食堂に集まった頃か。
msgctxt "0058 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...then that was just about an hour ago. Right when we\n"
"were all meeting in the dining hall..."
msgstr ""

#. わたくしは襲われた際に、
#. 気を失ってしまいました。
msgctxt "0059 | CELES"
msgid "The attack caused me to lose consciousness."
msgstr ""

#. そこから今まで…
#. １時間ほど気を失っていたようです。
msgctxt "0060 | CELES"
msgid "Which would mean, I was unconscious for about an hour."
msgstr ""

#. でも…軽傷で済んでよかったよ…
msgctxt "0061 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Well, I'm just glad you weren't hurt too badly..."
msgstr ""

#. 全力で命乞いをしましたから…
msgctxt "0062 | CELES"
msgid "That is because I begged and groveled for my life..."
msgstr ""

#. 命乞い…？
msgctxt "0063 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "You did?"
msgstr ""

#. 本当になんでもしますから命だけは助けてください…
#. 舐められる所は全部舐めますから助けてください…
msgctxt "0064 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I told him I would do anything if he spared me. I\n"
"offered to lick his boots, whatever it took..."
msgstr ""

#. 見事なプライドの捨てようだ…
msgctxt "0065 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "So you were willing to throw away all your pride..."
msgstr ""

#. これも…生き抜く為の術ですわ…
msgctxt "0066 | CELES"
msgid "It is a necessary skill for survival."
msgstr ""

#. そんな事より、すぐに不審者を捜しましょう。
msgctxt "0067 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Anyway, the important thing now is that we go search\n"
"for the suspicious individual."
msgstr ""

#. 急がないと…<CLT 1>【大変な事】<CLT>になりかねません…
msgctxt "0068 | CELES"
msgid ""
"If we do not hurry,\n"
"this could become a <CLT 1>[serious problem]<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大変な…事？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A serious...problem?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うかつでしたわ…
#. あんな妙な不審者に襲われるなんて…
msgctxt "0070 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I was careless to allow a clearly suspicious person to\n"
"attack me like that..."
msgstr ""

#. 存在自体が妙である不審者に、
#. さらに“妙な”という形容詞を付けたくなるほどの…
msgctxt "0071 | CELES"
msgid ""
"A suspicious person whose existence is so unusual, I\n"
"can't help but call him strange..."
msgstr ""

#. まさに、<CLT 3>“妙な不審者”<CLT>でしたわ…
msgctxt "0072 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Without a doubt, it was some sort of <CLT 3>strange\n"
"suspicious individual<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そんな妙な不審者に襲われたのです。
#. そこに落ちている<CLT 3>ハンマー<CLT>で…
msgctxt "0073 | CELES"
msgid ""
"And that man attacked me, with the <CLT 3>hammer<CLT> on the\n"
"ground there..."
msgstr ""

#. 急いで、あの不審者を見つけないと…
#. <CLT 1>【大変な事】<CLT>になりかねませんわ。
msgctxt "0074 | CELES"
msgid ""
"We must find the strange man before it is too late,\n"
"and it becomes a <CLT 1>[serious problem]<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 不審者ってどういう事？
#. な、何がどうなってるのかな！？
msgctxt "0075 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"What does she mean by \"suspicious individual\"? What's\n"
"going on here!?"
msgstr ""

#. その不審者とやらについて…
#. 詳しい話を…聞くべきだな。
msgctxt "0076 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "We need to find out more about this strange person..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …って、あんな物を気にしてる場合じゃない！
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But I can't worry about that right now...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. きっと今も、この向こうで…黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now, the mastermind is probably on the other side\n"
"of that surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…って、あんな物を気にしてる場合じゃない！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I can't worry about that right now...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここで出て行っても仕方ない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Leaving isn't going to do any good...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>雑誌棚だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a shelf full of magazines.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>色々なジャンルの雑誌が揃っているみたいだけど、
#. 今は気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of magazines here, but I don't have\n"
"time now to look at them...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>オセロ…
#. こんな物を気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Othello... I don't have time to think about this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ダーツ…
#. こんな物を気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A dartboard... I don't have time to think about\n"
"this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな物を気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to think about this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーがあるけど…
#. こんな物を気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A locker... I don't have time to think about this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなソファーなんかを気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to think about couches...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなテーブルなんかを気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to think about tables...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんかのインテリアみたいだけど…
#. こんな物に気を取られている場合じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like some kind of decoration. But I don't\n"
"have time to think about it...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんかのインテリアみたいだけど…
#. こんな物に気を取られている場合じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like some kind of decoration. But I don't\n"
"have time to think about it...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんかのインテリアみたいだけど…
#. こんな物に気を取られている場合じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like some kind of decoration. But I don't\n"
"have time to think about it...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんかのインテリアみたいだけど…
#. こんな物に気を取られている場合じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like some kind of decoration. But I don't\n"
"have time to think about it...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんかのインテリアみたいだけど…
#. こんな物に気を取られている場合じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like some kind of decoration. But I don't\n"
"have time to think about it...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんかのインテリアみたいだけど…
#. こんな物に気を取られている場合じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like some kind of decoration. But I don't\n"
"have time to think about it...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…なんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What is this...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>木槌…みたいだけど…
#. やけに変わったデザインだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's some kind of...wooden hammer or something? Pretty\n"
"strange design...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>先端の塊の部分に…何か文字が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some writing on the head...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ジャスティス……ハンマー…１号…？
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Justice...Hammer...1?"
msgstr ""

#. そのハンマーで…襲われたのです…
msgctxt "0100 | CELES"
msgid "That is the hammer he attacked me with."
msgstr ""

#. 間一髪のところで避けたのですが、
#. その際に、転んでしまって…
msgctxt "0101 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I barely managed to avoid the blow, but I stumbled and\n"
"fell."
msgstr ""

#. 日頃の運動不足が…たたりましたわね…
msgctxt "0102 | CELES"
msgid "I now curse my lack of daily exercise..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このハンマーで…襲われた…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So you were attacked...with this?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても…
#. ジャスティスハンマー１号って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Justice Hammer 1...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木、セレスちゃん！！
msgctxt "0105 | NO NAME"
msgid "Makoto! Celeste!"
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃんを連れて来たよッ！
msgctxt "0106 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I found Sakura!"
msgstr ""

#. セ、セレス…
#. 一体どうしたと言うのだ…？
msgctxt "0107 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "C-Celeste... What on Earth happened here?"
msgstr ""

#. 不審者に襲われたらしいんだけど…
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Apparently she was attacked by some kind of strange\n"
"man..."
msgstr ""

#. 不審者…だと？
msgctxt "0109 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "A...strange man?"
msgstr ""

#. …セレスよ、詳しく教えろ。
#. その不審者とやらの事…
msgctxt "0110 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Tell us everything you can remember, Celeste. Be as\n"
"detailed as you can..."
msgstr ""

#. えっと…今朝の事でした…
msgctxt "0111 | CELES"
msgid "Well, it all happened earlier this morning..."
msgstr ""

#. わたくしは、夜時間が明ける７時前に
#. 目が覚めてしまいました…
msgctxt "0112 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I woke up a little before 7 a.m. Nighttime was not yet\n"
"over..."
msgstr ""

#. もうすぐ夜時間も明ける事ですし、
#. 少しくらい、いいだろうという甘い考えで…
msgctxt "0113 | CELES"
msgid ""
"But I knew it was about to end, so I decided it would\n"
"be okay if I..."
msgstr ""

#. 学校の１階を、ぶらぶら散歩していたのです。
msgctxt "0114 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I decided to take a little stroll around the 1st\n"
"floor."
msgstr ""

#. …それが間違いでしたわ。
msgctxt "0115 | CELES"
msgid "...I understand now that that was a mistake."
msgstr ""

#. そこで、わたくしは不審者を見かけたのです。
#. 顔を隠した見るからに怪しい不審者でしたわ。
msgctxt "0116 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Anyway, that is where I first saw the strange man. I\n"
"was immediately wary of him..."
msgstr ""

#. 見るからに怪しいので、
#. わたくしは、こっそり後をつける事にしたのです。
msgctxt "0117 | CELES"
msgid ""
"He was obviously suspicious, so I decided to follow\n"
"after him in secret."
msgstr ""

#. すると、不審者がこの娯楽室に入ったので、
#. こっそりドアの隙間から中を覗こうとして…
msgctxt "0118 | CELES"
msgid ""
"As I followed, I saw him go into the rec room. I tried\n"
"to peek through the gap in the door..."
msgstr ""

#. …そこで不審者に見つかってしまい、
#. 襲われてしまいました。
msgctxt "0119 | CELES"
msgid "...which is when he noticed me, and..."
msgstr ""

#. では、お主が襲われたのは…
msgctxt "0120 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "And that's when you were attacked."
msgstr ""

#. わたくしが襲われたのは夜時間が明けた直後…
#. <CLT 3>朝の７時過ぎ<CLT>でしたわ…
msgctxt "0121 | CELES"
msgid ""
"It happened <CLT 3>after 7 a.m.<CLT>, just after nighttime had\n"
"ended."
msgstr ""

#. 襲われたのが７時過ぎって事は…
msgctxt "0122 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So if it happened just after 7 o'clock..."
msgstr ""

#. 今から１時間ほど前だな。
#. 我らが食堂に集まった頃か。
msgctxt "0123 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...then that was just about an hour ago. Right when we\n"
"were all meeting in the dining hall..."
msgstr ""

#. わたくしは襲われた際に、
#. 気を失ってしまいました。
msgctxt "0124 | CELES"
msgid "The attack caused me to lose consciousness."
msgstr ""

#. そこから今まで…
#. １時間ほど気を失っていたようです。
msgctxt "0125 | CELES"
msgid "Which would mean, I was unconscious for about an hour."
msgstr ""

#. でも…軽傷で済んでよかったよ…
msgctxt "0126 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Well, I'm just glad you weren't hurt too badly..."
msgstr ""

#. 全力で命乞いをしましたから…
msgctxt "0127 | CELES"
msgid "That is because I begged and groveled for my life..."
msgstr ""

#. 命乞い…？
msgctxt "0128 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "You did?"
msgstr ""

#. 本当になんでもしますから命だけは助けてください…
#. 舐められる所は全部舐めますから助けてください…
msgctxt "0129 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I told him I would do anything if he spared me. I\n"
"offered to lick his boots, whatever it took..."
msgstr ""

#. 見事なプライドの捨てようだ…
msgctxt "0130 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "So you were willing to throw away all your pride..."
msgstr ""

#. これも…生き抜く為の術ですわ…
msgctxt "0131 | CELES"
msgid "It is a necessary skill for survival."
msgstr ""

#. そんな事より、すぐに不審者を捜しましょう。
msgctxt "0132 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Anyway, the important thing now is that we go search\n"
"for the suspicious individual."
msgstr ""

#. 急がないと…<CLT 1>【大変な事】<CLT>になりかねません…
msgctxt "0133 | CELES"
msgid ""
"If we do not hurry,\n"
"this could become a <CLT 1>[serious problem]<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大変な…事？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0134 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A serious...problem?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>カラフルに塗られた木槌みたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's some kind of brightly colored wooden hammer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ジャスティスハンマー１号って…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Justice Hammer 1...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここで出て行っても仕方ない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Leaving isn't going to do any good...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …事情はわかった。
#. いや、わからん事も多いが…
msgctxt "0138 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I believe I understand what happened. Well, no, there\n"
"is much I don't understand. But..."
msgstr ""

#. とにかく…その画像の不審者が…
#. 山田を連れ去っていったのだな…
msgctxt "0139 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The point is, someone dressed like that dragged Hifumi\n"
"away."
msgstr ""

#. しかも…１時間も前に…
msgctxt "0140 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And it happened over an hour ago..."
msgstr ""

#. ヤバいよ！　急がないとッ！
msgctxt "0141 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "This is bad! We have to hurry!"
msgstr ""

#. …セレスさん、
#. 不審者はどこに行ったかわかる？
msgctxt "0142 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Celeste, do you know where this mysterious man went?"
msgstr ""

#. 娯楽室を出て、左正面に進んで行ってたので…
msgctxt "0143 | CELES"
msgid "When they left the rec room, they headed left..."
msgstr ""

#. 左正面となると、
#. ２階に降りる階段だな！！
msgctxt "0144 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If that's true, they were headed toward the stairs\n"
"leading down to the 2nd floor!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、不審者は２階に！？
msgctxt "0145 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then he must be down there, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. ２階って…
#. 霧切ちゃんが捜索しているはずだったよね…
msgctxt "0146 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"The 2nd floor... That's where Kyoko was supposed to\n"
"be..."
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？　そう言えば霧切さんは？
msgctxt "0147 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Speaking of which, why isn't Kyoko here?"
msgstr ""

#. ゴメン…私もまだ２階の方は見てないよ…
msgctxt "0148 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Sorry...I didn't have time to go look for her."
msgstr ""

#. マズイな。犯人が２階にいるなら、
#. 鉢合わせになっていてもおかしくない…
msgctxt "0149 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"This is bad. If the strange man did head to the 2nd\n"
"floor, Kyoko might run into him..."
msgstr ""

#. …急ごう！　霧切さんが危険だよ！
msgctxt "0150 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "We have to hurry! Kyoko's in danger!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>言い終わるや否や、ボクらは娯楽室を飛び出し、
#. そのまま２階へと駆け下りていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0151 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As soon as the words were out of my mouth, we all\n"
"rushed out of the room and down to the 2nd floor.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
